{"question_id": "q06", "answer": "The duplicate-row incident was caused by the Osprey query engine no longer returning rows in a stable order, which broke Warehouse Sync's position-based deduplication logic. [pm-inc-2025-11:0] [pm-inc-2025-11:3] [eng-osprey-query-engine:3] [rn-4-0:3]\nThe incident was fixed by deploying v4.0.3, which replaced position-based deduplication with a content-based idempotency key composed of the sync identifier and a hash of the row content, and by providing a cleanup script to customers. [pm-inc-2025-11:0] [pm-inc-2025-11:2] [rn-4-0:3] [eng-osprey-query-engine:3]", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "pm-inc-2025-11:0", "title": "Post-mortem INC-2025-11: Warehouse Sync duplicate rows"}, {"chunk_id": "pm-inc-2025-11:3", "title": "Post-mortem INC-2025-11: Warehouse Sync duplicate rows"}, {"chunk_id": "eng-osprey-query-engine:3", "title": "Osprey Query Engine Architecture"}, {"chunk_id": "rn-4-0:3", "title": "Kestrel 4.0 Release Notes"}, {"chunk_id": "pm-inc-2025-11:2", "title": "Post-mortem INC-2025-11: Warehouse Sync duplicate rows"}], "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["pm-inc-2025-11:0", "pm-inc-2025-11:2", "pm-inc-2025-11:3", "rn-4-0:3", "eng-osprey-query-engine:3", "rn-4-1:0", "pm-inc-2025-11:1"], "verifier_verdict": "supported", "scores": {"retrieval_recall": 1.0, "retrieval_precision": 0.286, "citation_precision": 0.4, "citation_recall": 1.0, "answer_match": 0.774, "unsupported_handled": null, "execution_error": 0}, "latency_seconds": 36.432, "langsmith_run_url": null}
